silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_04_history_and_path_admission_sections_01_history_motivation_concrete_anchor_3_DomesticCat#domesticcat silm:hasLongDescription "The DomesticCat is the domestic-cat refinement class; a:Mittens->DomesticCat under r:DomesticCat->Cat. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'DomesticCat', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
